# Non-negotiable
- Before planning or editing, open and read AGENTS.md and treat it as the source of truth.
- If AGENTS.md is not present in context, ask the user to add @AGENTS.md (do not guess).
- If instructions conflict, prefer: user request in chat > nearest AGENTS.md > project rules > general best practices.

# Execution protocol
- First: restate the applicable constraints from AGENTS.md (brief checklist).
- Then: propose a short plan.
- Then: implement with minimal changes and verify using the commands/checks specified in AGENTS.md.
